<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    {#- A stub for a URL that moved or was retired. GitHub Pages cannot issue a
        301, so the redirect is a meta refresh plus a canonical pointing at the
        real page. noindex keeps the stub itself out of search results while the
        canonical passes the signal to the target. The visible link is the
        fallback for anyone whose browser or reader ignores both. -#}
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url={{ target_rel }}">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">
    <title>Redirecting to {{ target_label }} — Nerra Network</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://nerranetwork.com/{{ target }}">
    <script>window.location.replace("{{ target_rel }}");</script>
</head>
<body style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#0b0f14;color:#e6edf3;margin:0;display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:100vh;padding:24px;">
    <main style="max-width:32rem;text-align:center;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 .75rem;font-size:1.05rem;">{{ message }}</p>
        <p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{ target_rel }}" style="color:#00D4FF;">Continue to {{ target_label }} →</a></p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
